{"anon_id": "P3-b8adf87f", "direction": 1, "claims": 0, "timing": 0, "total": 1, "pass": false, "gap_note": "实死在午年子月、远在占后数年，本月不吉与亥日最不利点均无证且尺度全偏"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b945d706", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "功名保全得实，戌日应期无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-b98d8182", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "果取超等合上等之断，酉日应期无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bbd416a0", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 1, "total": 1, "pass": false, "gap_note": "特朗普实败于拜登，与连任胜选正相反，仅投票揭晓时点对齐"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bbd8dd1c", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bc07292b", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "抽兵而退合折回之断，将士损耗未见载，巳月应期无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bc9a866a", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "叔不责侄合无害之断，寅日应期无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bd7674dd", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bd829300", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "其子迁入半月内出花而死合祸应子孙，寅月主坐标偏"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bdf5a068", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "历任要职合权位一面，省主席上将之具体级未见载，运段无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-be6a9bb5", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "赢初选与大选大败得实，初选落点七月中、与上半年框部分偏"}
{"anon_id": "P3-be8f5969", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-bf6e3242", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "次日卯时放晴合雪止之断，子日主坐标未确对齐"}
{"anon_id": "P3-c00e43a5", "direction": 2, "claims": 1, "timing": 1, "total": 4, "pass": true, "gap_note": "他官顶位、本人赴京另补合失位不绝，劾案发动本身未明载，酉日无时点可核（中性记1）"}
{"anon_id": "P3-c0aae3eb", "direction": 0, "claims": 0, "timing": 0, "total": 0, "pass": false, "gap_note": "果得见于丙子日，与谒贵不见正相反"}
{"anon_id": "P3-c0ade72b", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 2, "total": 6, "pass": true, "gap_note": "无"}
{"anon_id": "P3-c0b0aa33", "direction": 2, "claims": 2, "timing": 1, "total": 5, "pass": true, "gap_note": "其疾果不死合可愈之断，戌日应期未核，半年内溺水亡属病外之变"}
